  "question": {
    "text": "A gas has molar heat capacity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>37</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>55</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, in this process <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo></math> constant. The number of degree of freedom of the molecule of gas is",
    "image": null
  },
